# JobAgent — Complete How to Use Guide & Workflow Manual

Welcome to **JobAgent**, a local-first, privacy-respecting AI job application assistant. JobAgent automates job collection, deterministic filtering, local AI matching, application package preparation, and browser autofill while keeping all critical approval and submission decisions in human hands.

