## 1. Architecture Overview

JobAgent runs completely on your local machine:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Next.js Web Dashboard                    │
│            http://localhost:3000 (App Router)               │
│  - Dashboard: System metrics, match scores, recent jobs     │
│  - Review Queue: Approve / Reject pending jobs              │
│  - Jobs Directory: Search, filter, and detail drawer        │
│  - Applications Hub: Packages, preparation, autofill runner │
│  - Settings: Candidate profile and matching configuration   │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                           │ HTTP REST (Native Fetch, No SQLite)
┌──────────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐
│                    FastAPI Backend Layer                    │
│                http://127.0.0.1:8000                        │
│  - Reads SQLite (data/jobs.db)                              │
│  - Interacts with Ollama (Local AI)                         │
│  - Manages background automation tasks & single-concurrency │
│  - Writes profile atomically (data/profile.json)            │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                           │ Subprocess execution
┌──────────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐
│              Playwright Browser Automation                  │
│  - Non-headless Chromium window on user desktop             │
│  - Uploads resume PDF & fills candidate fields              │
│  - Answers custom Greenhouse questions                      │
│  - Verifies form state & pauses at READY TO SUBMIT gate     │
│  - Strictly requires human confirmation before submitting   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

