## 3. Step-by-Step Setup from Scratch

Follow these steps from a fresh clone of the repository.

### A. Clone the Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/SafiMaaz01/JobAgent.git
cd JobAgent
```

### B. Setup Python Virtual Environment
Open PowerShell or your terminal in the `JobAgent` root directory:

```powershell
# Create virtual environment
python -m venv .venv

# Activate virtual environment on Windows PowerShell
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1

# (If on Windows Command Prompt: .venv\Scripts\activate.bat)
# (If on macOS/Linux: source .venv/bin/activate)
```

### C. Install Python Dependencies
```powershell
pip install --upgrade pip
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### D. Install Playwright Chromium Browser
Playwright requires the Chromium binary to launch visible automation windows:

```powershell
playwright install chromium
```

### E. Setup and Start Ollama Local AI
Make sure Ollama is installed and running on your system:

```powershell
# In a separate terminal or background, start Ollama:
ollama serve

# Pull the Qwen 2.5 7B model used by the matcher:
ollama pull qwen2.5:7b
```

### F. Install Frontend Next.js Dependencies
Navigate to the `frontend/` directory and install the packages:

```powershell
cd frontend
npm install
cd ..
```

