## 4. Data & Profile Configuration

JobAgent stores all user data and configurations in the `data/` folder:

| File Path | Description | Required? |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `data/profile.json` | Candidate profile (name, contact, skills, education, experience, target roles). | **Yes** |
| `data/resume.pdf` | Candidate resume file uploaded during browser autofill. | **Yes** |
| `data/sources.json` | Greenhouse job board endpoints and company sources. | **Yes** |
| `data/answers.json` | Question-answer mapping and default candidate responses. | **Yes** |
| `data/application_answers.json` | Saved application answer bank for custom questions. | **Yes** |
| `data/jobs.db` | SQLite database storing jobs, match evaluations, and review statuses. | Auto-created |

> **Important**: Ensure your resume is saved as `data/resume.pdf` (or `data/resume/resume.pdf`).

